    "chunk_text": "boc on his witegunge, \u00fee His boc is swi\u00f0e micel on manegum getacnungum, langsum her to secgende be hire gesetnyssum & hu He n\u00e6s na ofslagen, ac he him sylf gewat, \u00fea \u00fea he hund geara w\u00e6s & tyn gear on ylde, & he w\u00e6s Twelf witegan syndon to eacan \u00feisum git, \u00f0e twelf bec awriton on heora witegunge be sumum d\u00e6le \u00d0\u00e6ra naman we willa\u00f0 awritan on \u00feisum cwyde: OSEE, IOHEL, AMOS, ABDIAS, IONAS se \u00fee Iesus w\u00e6s gehaten ure H\u00e6lend on life, & swa s\u00e6de \u00fees witega, \u00e6r \u00f0an \u00fee he wurde acenned, & swa He ys gehaten eac Crist; be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0 sum witega for fela hund gearum, \u00e6r \u00fean \u00fee he acenned wurde: W\u00e6ron eac o\u00f0re witegan, \u00fee ne writon nane bec, swa swa w\u00e6s Helias & Heliseus, ac heora wundra Tyn m\u00e6dena w\u00e6ron on mislicre tide on h\u00e6\u00feenum leodum, \u00fea man het Sibillas, \u00fe\u00e6t synd witegestran, Esdras se writere awrat ane boc, hu \u00fe\u00e6t folc com ongean fram Chaldea lande to Iudea lande & hi Iob w\u00e6s gehaten sum heah Godes \u00feegen on \u00feam lande Chus, swi\u00f0e geleafull wer, welig on \u00e6htum; se Sum Iudeisc man wear\u00f0 eac afandod, Tobias gehaten, swi\u00f0e \u00e6lmesgeorn & swi\u00fee gelyfed on \u00feone Se w\u00e6s eac gehergod to Sirian lande, ac he heold swa \u00feeah his geleafan \u00fe\u00e6r mid godum weorcum & Hester seo cwen, \u00fe",
